---
// Reminders feature mock — a WhatsApp-style thread seen from the SALON's phone:
// AgendaLila's reminder is the SENT message (green, right); the client's reply
// is RECEIVED (grey, left). WhatsApp send is one-tap-assisted today (fully
// automatic WhatsApp is roadmap), so this reads as a real conversation.
---

<div class="w-[240px] overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-white p-4 shadow-[var(--shadow-lg)]">
  <div class="mb-2 text-center text-[11px] text-lilac-700/70">
    Mariana Castro · hoy 18:02
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col">
    {/* Salon → client: the reminder AgendaLila sends (sent = green, right) */}
    <div
      class="mb-2 ml-auto max-w-[88%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-[4px] px-3.5 py-[11px] text-[13px] leading-[1.4]"
      style="background:#d3f9d8; color:#1d4b2d;"
    >
      Hola Mariana 💜 te recordamos tu cita mañana <strong>martes 17 a las
      14:00</strong> en Amorelila Estética para extensión de pestañas voluminosas
      con Estefanía.
    </div>
    <div
      class="mb-1 ml-auto max-w-[88%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-[4px] px-3.5 py-[11px] text-[11px] leading-[1.4]"
      style="background:#d3f9d8; color:#1d4b2d;"
    >
      Si necesitás cambiarla, respondé acá o tocá → amorelila.agendalila.com
    </div>
    <div class="mb-2 px-1 text-right text-[10px] text-lilac-700/70">enviado · 18:02</div>
    {/* Client → salon: her reply (received = grey, left) */}
    <div
      class="max-w-[88%] self-start rounded-2xl rounded-bl-[4px] bg-lilac-150 px-3.5 py-[11px] text-[13px] leading-[1.4] text-lilac-900"
    >
      ¡Perfecto, ahí estaré! 💜
    </div>
    <div class="px-1 text-left text-[10px] text-lilac-700/70">18:04</div>
  </div>
</div>
